        "artist": "<a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/User:W.carter\" title=\"User:W.carter\">W.carter</a>",
        "description": "A tawny owl (<i>Strix aluco</i>) calling at night in Tuntorp, Brastad, Lysekil Municipality, Sweden. It flew around and called the forest next to my house from about 23:00 to 02:00. It would pause when it changed location. The recording is from two locations; there is a 1 sek pause at 3:44 to mark the relocation pause. Recording was made with the internal microphones of a camera, Sony Cyber-shot DSC-RX100, cut in <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shotcut\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Shotcut\">Shotcut</a> and background noise reduced in <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Audacity_(audio_editor)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Audacity (audio editor)\">Audacity</a>.",
